<title>JAPAN: Mikuni assigns preliminary bond credit ratings.</title>
<headline>Mikuni assigns preliminary bond credit ratings.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mikuni and Co Ltd said on Friday it had assigned the following preliminary ratings to planned bond issues:</p>
<p>-AA-</p>
<p>The 77 Bank Ltd.,, 20 billion yen unsecured convertible due 2002.</p>
<p>-A-</p>
<p>Hitachi Credit Corp, $200 million unsecured due 2001. Suncall Corp, 35 million Swiss Francs unsecured with warrants, due 2000, private placement, guaranteed by Sumitomo Trust &amp; Banking.  </p>
<p>-BB-</p>
<p>Horiba Ltd, 10 billion yen unsecured convertible due 2006.</p>
<p>Odakyu Electric Railway Co Ltd,</p>
<p>20 billion yen unsecured due 2006.</p>
<p>20 billion yen unsecured due 2016.</p>
<p>Kitagawa Iron Works Co Ltd, five billion yen unsecured convertible, due 2000, private placement.</p>
</text>
